   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Los números",
    "@en": "The numbers"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "Del 0 al 16 hay que aprenderlos de memoria. Del 17 al 19 se forman sumando: **dix-sept** (diez-siete), **dix-huit**, **dix-neuf**.",
     "@en": "From 0 to 16 you have to learn them by memory. From 17 to 19 they form adding: **dix-sept** (diez-seven), **dix-huit**, **dix-neuf**."
    },
    {
     "@es": "En **six** y **dix** aislados, la **x** suena /s/ («sis», «dis»); en **dix-huit** y **dix-neuf**, suena /z/. La **p** de **sept** no se pronuncia. En esta guía, **Z** representa /z/ (una «s» sonora, no la z española).",
     "@en": "In isolated **six** and **dix**, the **x** sounds / s / («sis», «dis»); in **dix-huit** and **dix-neuf**, it sounds / z /. **p** of **sept** is not pronounced. In this guide, **Z** represents / z / (a «s» sonora, not the Spanish z)."
    }
   ]
  },
